ng inactivity; if no response within a couple of weeks, initiate the process to move him to Emeritus status.\\n\\n*   **Tyler Yahn:**\\n\\n    *   Draft a cohesive comment and close the \\\"Exposed Temporality Selector Function\\\" PR.\\n\\n    *   Review Robert Pająk's parsing algorithm PR ([sdk/log: Fix AddAttributes, SetAttributes, SetBody on Record to not mutate input #7403](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7403)).\\n\\n    *   Add David Ashpole's metrics SDK optimization PRs (histogram reservoir, last value) to the current milestone.\\n\\n*   **All Attendees:**\\n\\n    *   Review Robert Pająk's parsing algorithm PR ([sdk/log: Fix AddAttributes, SetAttributes, SetBody on Record to not mutate input #7403](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7403)).\\n\\n    *   Review David Ashpole's metrics SDK optimization PRs (especially the histogram reservoir one).\\n\\n    *   Prioritize reviews for critical PRs to facilitate a release before KubeCon.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src note 04 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2025 11 03 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 issuecom 3479584781 author pellar creat 2025 11 03t09 18 08z updat 2025 11 03t09 18 08z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z date 2025 10 16 attende tyler yahn damien mathieu bryan boreham david ashpol robert paj ą k action item damien mathieu respond to the otelgin context revers in datarac issu pr http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib pull 8014 http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib pull 8014 suggest pass context to spawn go routin follow up with chengzhen scorpion knife regard inact if no respons within a coupl of week initi the process to move him to emeritus status tyler yahn draft a cohes comment and close the expos tempor selector function pr review robert paj ą k s pars algorithm pr sdk log fix addattribut setattribut setbodi on record to not mutat input 7403 http github com open telemetri opent